<title>SRI LANKA: WEATHER-Sri Lanka weather forecast.</title>
<headline>WEATHER-Sri Lanka weather forecast.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Tuesday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Bowathenna		21.3</p>
<p>    Canyon		    5.3</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     4.2</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   0</p>
<p>    Laxapana		  0</p>
<p>    Moussakele		5.5</p>
<p>    Norton		    0</p>
<p>    Polgolla		  0</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     0</p>
<p>    Victoria		  0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    0</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   39.6</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  0</p>
<p>The department forecast scattered thunder showers at times in the Eastern and Northern provinces and showers particularly during the evening over the rest of the island on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
